sequenceDiagram
 participant W as Worker
 participant P as PostgreSQL
 participant X as Provider
 W->>P: claim leased job
 W->>X: request
 X-->>W: timeout/error
 W->>P: retry_wait with bounded backoff
 W->>P: retry attempts
 W->>P: dead_letter on exhaustion
 Note over W,P: no blind replay; operator records decision
